{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Asgore\n🌻 Father of Kris and Asriel, Toriel's ex-husband; owner of the \"Flower King\" flower shop in Hometown.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"4"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Toriel**\nEx-wife; they divorced before the start of the game.","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**Kris and Asriel**\nFather of both. In Ch.5 he laments not having protected Kris better after discovering the real danger of the Dark Fountain in his own flower shop.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Asgore_Dreemurr_overworld_hug.gif","x":750,"y":-300,"width":170,"height":141},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Flowery**\nHis old golden flower, cared for over the years; Flowery spends all of Ch.5 keeping him happy and distracted, using his nostalgia as a tool.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Flowery_y_Asgore.webp","x":750,"y":260,"width":170,"height":128},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Carol Holiday**\nHis landlady — Asgore owes rent on the flower shop, which she generously allows him.","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Asgore_y_Carol_corcho.webp","x":-130,"y":740,"width":190,"height":133},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Rudy**\nOld college friend; he visits him often in the hospital, brings him roses, and includes him in his prayers.","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"6"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**What is the tragedy he doesn't fully reveal?**","x":-680,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":101,"color":"1"},{"id":"s6","type":"text","text":"**Asgore's secret corkboard**\nHis document board in the Flower King basement — a match for Carol's — suggests they share an undisclosed investigation related to the Shelter.","x":900,"y":-20,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"1"},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Flower_King_location_second_floor.png","x":1230,"y":-20,"width":170,"height":128},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Asgore_and_Toriel_overworld_awkward.gif","x":-85,"y":-840,"width":190,"height":143},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Asgore_Dreemurr_overworld.webp","x":-57,"y":-295,"width":134,"height":190},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/That_Day_soundtrack.png","x":-625,"y":-388,"width":170,"height":128},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Asgore_y_Rudy_universidad.png","x":-1002,"y":62,"width":322,"height":523},{"id":"s7","type":"text","text":"**Alphys**\nFriends since before the start of the game: he gives her flowers in exchange for news about Kris, and they share a fondness for *Mew Mew Kissy Cutie*. She gave him the figure revealed to be Pink in Ch.5.","x":-340,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"4"},{"id":"s7-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/alphys_sprite_transparent_v2.png","x":-340,"y":30,"width":114,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"3"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e6_x3","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s6","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e7","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s7","toSide":"left","color":"4"},{"id":"e_s7-img","fromNode":"s7-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s7","toSide":"top","color":"4"}]}